    {
      "id": "scene-01-seam",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdAfterNarration": 2000,
      "description": "Underground mine tunnel with timber supports, lantern on left wall, diamond barely visible in coal seam — carbon buried under immense pressure",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-01-seam.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "The ground either feeds you or buries you.",
            "enter": 1300,
            "exit": 4500,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 20
          },
          {
            "text": "Buchanan County, Virginia.",
            "enter": 5000,
            "exit": 9000,
            "x": 69,
            "y": 30
          },
          {
            "text": "Miner or miner's wife.",
            "enter": 10000,
            "exit": 15000,
            "x": 13,
            "y": 40
          },
          {
            "text": "Most came home.",
            "enter": 25000,
            "exit": 28000,
            "x": 73,
            "y": 75
          },
          {
            "text": "That's what we called living.",
            "enter": 30000,
            "exit": 35000,
            "x": 43,
            "y": 78
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "I come from a place where the ground either feeds you or buries you.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4500
          },
          {
            "text": "Buchanan County is one of the poorest in the whole state of Virginia.",
            "start": 5700,
            "end": 9700
          },
          {
            "text": "And if you weren't a miner, then that meant you're a miner's wife and probably didn't have a pot to piss in.",
            "start": 10000,
            "end": 16500
          },
          {
            "text": "In these mountains, you ain't got many other options.",
            "start": 17000,
            "end": 22000
          },
          {
            "text": "Every single day I watched my daddy go underground knowing most men came back home.",
            "start": 22000,
            "end": 28200
          },
          {
            "text": "Not all of them, mind you, but most.",
            "start": 28800,
            "end": 32000
          },
          {
            "text": "That's just what we called living.",
            "start": 32000,
            "end": 34500
          }
        ]
      },
      "effects": {
        "regions": [
          {
