    {
      "id": "scene-10-building",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdAfterNarration": 3000,
      "description": "Woman kneeling, soldering components on a wood frame, diamond glowing on floor, circuit traces on walls — carbon activated into something new",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-10-building.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "Smart things.",
            "enter": 2000,
            "exit": 5000,
            "x": 76,
            "y": 10
          },
          {
            "text": "Every hot coal led me right here.",
            "enter": 11000,
            "exit": 17000,
            "x": 4,
            "y": 20
          },
          {
            "text": "Cutting one of my own.",
            "enter": 21000,
            "exit": 24000,
            "x": 70,
            "y": 66
          },
          {
            "text": "Worth having.",
            "enter": 32000,
            "exit": 34000,
            "x": 86,
            "y": 78
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "Now, I build things. Smart things.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4900
          },
          {
            "text": "That's what a girl from a little old coal town can do when she gets her hands on the right parts.",
            "start": 4900,
            "end": 11000
          },
          {
            "text": "Every hard thing I've done.",
            "start": 11000,
            "end": 13000
          },
          {
            "text": "Every hot coal I walked straight across led me right here.",
            "start": 13000,
            "end": 17500
          },
          {
            "text": "Not cause the path was easy. Because I got used to cutting one of my own.",
            "start": 18000,
            "end": 24000
          },
          {
            "text": "And the work ain't always pretty. Sometimes it's hands and wires and not knowing if it'll hold.",
            "start": 24000,
            "end": 31000
          },
          {
            "text": "But how you build anything that's worth having.",
            "start": 31000,
            "end": 34000
          }
        ]
      },
